  "change_summary": [
    "A private generic quotient/inverse specialization wraps the already compiled relativeHeightProduct_allJets_fixed_loss. It reuses exactly its selected low order, loss and B envelope and applies that same product estimate twice to the two scalar factor pairs.",
    "The scalar function equalities and PointwiseMaterialJetBound congruence now elaborate only over abstract p,A,B,z,f0,f,g,x. Nonzero values are supplied by the original actual height positivity, and all four original scalar factor bounds are required explicitly.",
