    "The complete family definition, both public headers, imports, namespace, options, true root-image transport, original data/witness and all main proof bytes through tau jets are unchanged except selecting this private wrapper.",
    "Default limits remain unchanged. The source does not introduce an additional estimate, new sample, root, state neighborhood or higher loss."
